BEGIN_PGML Subtract [`-1`] from [`9\text{.}`]
[_]{10}{10}
END_PGML
########## # Solution ##########
BEGIN_PGML_SOLUTION After writing this as [`9-(-1)\text{,}`] we can change to [`9+1`] and get [`10\text{.}`]
END_PGML_SOLUTION
