BEGIN_PGML Subtract [`32-50\text{.}`]
[_]{-18}{10}
END_PGML
########## # Solution ##########
BEGIN_PGML_SOLUTION We can change this to [`32+(-50)\text{.}`] Two numbers are added, and the larger one is negative. So we find the difference [`50-32=18\text{,}`] but the final result must be negative: [`-18\text{.}`]
END_PGML_SOLUTION
