BEGIN_PGML Find the difference [`-12.04-17.2\text{.}`]
[_]{-29.24}{10}
END_PGML
########## # Solution ##########
BEGIN_PGML_SOLUTION Since we are subtracting a positive number from a negative number, the result should be an even more negative number. We can add [`12.04+17.2`] to get [`29.24\text{,}`] but our final answer should be the opposite, [`-29.24\text{.}`]
END_PGML_SOLUTION
